-                                    <li><strong>Custom Binder</strong> — same printable binder format, but you pick the archetypes that go in. Save / load named presets ("Travel", "Regionals Q3", etc.) so you don't rebuild from scratch each event.</li>
-                                </ul>
-                                <h3 class="tutorial-chapter-heading"><span>🃏</span> Decks</h3>
-                                <ul class="feature-banner-bullets">
-                                    <li><strong>My Decks</strong> — save any Deck Builder result with a name + format tag. Synced across devices. The ★ button on any card swaps prints without losing the per-card count.</li>
-                                    <li><strong>Compare Decklists</strong> — paste two lists (or pick two saved builds) and get a color-coded diff: cards added, cut, count changes. The cleanest way to track tech additions between events.</li>
-                                </ul>
-                                <h3 class="tutorial-chapter-heading"><span>⚔️</span> Play &amp; Analysis</h3>
-                                <ul class="feature-banner-bullets">
-                                    <li><strong>Battle Journal</strong> — header ⚔️ button logs a match in under 10 seconds: deck, opponent, turn order, result, notes. Works offline, cloud-syncs as soon as you reconnect. Brick / mulligan flags filter out unlucky games before WR is computed.</li>
-                                    <li><strong>Testing Groups</strong> — private match-log + shared Meta Call for your testing crew. Every member's journal rolls into one trend chart; group prediction has edit history so you see who changed what, when.</li>
-                                    <li><strong>Meta Call</strong> — the predictor itself, also reachable from the Meta Hub. Predicts the deck distribution at your next event, computes Day-2 chance against it, and Bayesian-blends your Journal data on top.</li>
-                                </ul>
