-                                    <li><strong>Top-8 Conversion</strong> — <em>(Top-8 finishes) ÷ (deck entries of the same archetype)</em>. Surfaces the "low share, high punch" decks that brought show alone hides.</li>
-                                    <li><strong>Archetype Overview</strong> — every legal archetype in the current format with a one-glance legality stamp (e.g. TEF-CRI) and the rolling climbers/fallers with WR delta vs the previous window.</li>
-                                    <li><strong>Live entry counter</strong> — the <em>6 687 deck entries</em> badge re-prints with every refresh; small samples flag themselves visually instead of hiding behind a confident-looking percentage.</li>
-                                </ul>
-                                <div class="feature-banner-protip">
-                                    <strong>Pro tip:</strong> If a row sits at &lt; 30 games in the window, treat its WR and matchup numbers as directional, not predictive. The Cooking-mode filter row lets you widen the window when the sample is thin.
