-                        <aside class="tutorial-callout">
-                            <strong>How the Meta Call field is composed</strong>
-                            <p>Field % per opponent = weighted blend of the last 5 in-person Majors + the rolling 14-day online ladder. Recent in-person results get an underdog-champion booster (a regional winner crossing &lt; 2 % usage gets bumped one week ahead of the model). Format-leader consolidation kicks in within multi-variant families — once a parent archetype crosses 25 % within-family share, sub-variants get folded back into the parent's bucket so the field isn't double-counted.</p>
-                        </aside>
-
-                        <h3 class="tutorial-chapter-heading"><span>05</span> Cooking — Deck Builder, PIN &amp; Exclude</h3>
