+                        <aside class="tutorial-callout">
+                            <strong>How "share %" is calculated</strong>
+                            <p>Share is always a ratio against the <em>active data window</em>, not against an all-time pool. Default window = last 30 days. Cooking lets you slice that down to a single tournament or stretch it as far back as the rotation goes. The window drives every percentage on the page — change it, and every number recalculates in lock-step.</p>
