+                                </p>
+                                <ul class="feature-banner-bullets">
+                                    <li><strong>Where suggestions come from</strong> — the card-text capability engine scans every card's printed text and tags its interactions. Build vs… then intersects those tags with the threats your picked targets actually pose.</li>
+                                    <li><strong>Threat tags on each card</strong> — labelled in blue next to each suggestion so the "why this card?" is right there. Surfer tagged <code>RETREAT_LOCK</code> against N's Zoroark; Shaymin tagged <code>BENCH_DAMAGE</code>.</li>
