+                                    <li><strong>Your Build vs Vanilla</strong> — same archetype, with vs without your tech overrides, weighted against the Meta Call field. <em>Vanilla 52.2 % → Your Build 52.8 %, Δ +0.6 pts</em>.</li>
+                                    <li><strong>Per-opponent breakdown</strong> — the table at the bottom shows where the Δ actually came from. You see the +3 pts vs N's Zoroark and Dragapult Dusknoir come from the retreat-lock techs.</li>
+                                    <li><strong>Estimator cap</strong> — Δ is hard-capped at +9 pts to keep claims honest; the per-card threat-bonus is <em>+3 pts per matched threat category</em>.</li>
